# Nikotian — Netlify response headers (performance v2, 19/11/2026)
# Fonts never change under the same name: cache for a year. Photographs: a week (a replaced photo with the
# same file name reaches visitors within 7 days). HTML, CSS, JS, data: Netlify's default (always revalidated),
# so every deploy is visible at once during the review phase.

/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/photos/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/assets/logo/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
